    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d140">

                <pb facs="0198" n="138" xml:id="pg138"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Denby to Mr. Olney</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-09-19"><hi rendition="#italic">September 19,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Interview with the minister for foreign affairs more satisfactory. Will have
                    conclusive answer two days. Have directed members of commission to prepare
                    go.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Denby</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
